WEBVTT

00:06:59.708 --> 00:07:03.667
that is unused or not used optimally,
like parking lots, for example.

00:07:05.292 --> 00:07:06.768
In my own city of Mumbai,

00:07:06.792 --> 00:07:09.893
where I practice
as an architect and a planner,

00:07:09.917 --> 00:07:12.518
I see this in the everyday landscape.

00:07:12.542 --> 00:07:14.476
I call this the Kinetic City.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.726
It twitches like a live organism;
it's not static.

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:19.559
It changes every day,

00:07:19.583 --> 00:07:22.184
on sometimes predictable cycles.

00:07:22.208 --> 00:07:23.851
About six million people

00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:27.351
live in these kinds
of temporary settlements.

00:07:27.375 --> 00:07:30.518
Like -- unfortunately, like refugee camps,